What this licence covers
------------------------

It covers the port's own work in this repository: the PC side of the game
(port/src), the launcher (port/launcher), the drawn icon (port/icon), the
tools (port/tools) and the documentation.

It does NOT cover:

- xboxrecomp (the xboxrecomp folder), the recompiler and Xbox runtime the
  port is built on. It keeps its own licence: MIT (xboxrecomp/LICENSE), with
  the files named in xboxrecomp/NOTICE, derived from xemu, under
  LGPL-2.1-or-later (xboxrecomp/LICENSES).
- Other third-party parts a release carries or the build fetches: SDL (zlib
  licence), LLVM's clang and lld (Apache-2.0 with LLVM exceptions), and the
  libraries under xboxrecomp/third_party. Each is under its own licence.
- The game itself. No game files, game code, art, audio or video from
  Buffy the Vampire Slayer are licensed by this file, and none are in this
  repository except the pictures in docs/media, which show the port running:
  what they show belongs to the game's owners and is not licensed here. You
  need your own legally obtained copy of the game. Buffy the Vampire Slayer
  and all related names and characters belong to their owners; The Collective
  developed the original game and Fox Interactive and Electronic Arts
  published it. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of
  them, or by Microsoft.


